  m_text: 'AI: "Psst, kitty! AI here.

    Naptime''s cancelled, an UFO just landed
    and... well, humans won''t cut it.

    You need to collect 6 trophies across
    the multiverse, using magic coins for the task. Save the world before your dinner
    bell rings!


    Enter the yellow star portals and embark on your Catverse Journey!"'
